      "id": "ateez-bad-golden-hour-5",
      "category": "COMEBACK",
      "cardBadge": "NEW RELEASE",
      "date": "Aug 19, 2026",
      "monthLabel": "AUG 2026",
      "source": "KQ ENTERTAINMENT / ATEEZ Official",
      "title": "ATEEZ Drop 'BAD' From GOLDEN HOUR : Part.5!",
      "excerpt": "Latin-heat title track with Mona Lisa flashes and Cohiba flow. MV and lyrics inside.",
      "quote": "8 makes 1 team — She's so bad!",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3F9jlnANW08/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "body": [
        "ATEEZ have officially released 'BAD', the title track from GOLDEN HOUR : Part.5, across official channels on Aug 19, 2026.",
        "The track blends Latin-pop rhythm with ATEEZ's signature performance energy, backed by a music video and lyric videos on ATEEZ Official channels.",
        "BAD arrives as part of the GOLDEN HOUR series, following the group's 2018 debut with Treasure EP.1: All to Zero under KQ Entertainment.",
        "Streaming and download links are open now on all major platforms."
      ]
    }
